@namespace Heimdall.Blazor
@* Trace-Detail: flache Span-Liste (Kind/Status/Dauer), verlinkt Parent. Attrs je Span
   aufklappbar (<details>, nativ, kein JS) → volle Attribute + Events. *@
@using System.Collections.Generic
@inject Heimdall.IHeimdallQuery Query
@inject Heimdall.Blazor.IHeimdallI18n I18n

<HeimdallDocument Title="@I18n.T("page.title.trace")" BasePath="@BasePath">
    <p class="hmd-back"><a href="@(BasePath + "/traces")">@I18n.T("trace.back")</a></p>
    <h1>@I18n.T("trace.title.prefix")<span class="hmd-mono">@TraceId</span></h1>

    @if (_spans.Count == 0)
    {
        <p class="hmd-empty" role="status">@I18n.T("trace.empty.spans")</p>
    }
    else
    {
        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_waterfall))
        {
            <h2 class="hmd-subhead">@I18n.T("trace.timeline.heading")</h2>
            <figure class="hmd-chart-wrap">@((MarkupString)_waterfall)</figure>
        }

        <h2 class="hmd-subhead">@I18n.T("trace.spans.heading")</h2>
        <table class="hmd-table hmd-dense">
            <caption>@I18n.T("trace.spans.heading")</caption>
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">@I18n.T("trace.col.span")</th><th scope="col">@I18n.T("trace.col.kind")</th><th scope="col">@I18n.T("table.start")</th><th scope="col">@I18n.T("table.duration")</th><th scope="col">@I18n.T("table.status")</th><th scope="col">@I18n.T("metrics.col.attrs")</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            @foreach (var s in _spans)
            {
                var attrs = HeimdallCharting.ParseAttrs(s.AttrsJson);
                <tr class="@(s.StatusCode == 2 ? "hmd-err" : "")">
                    <td>
                        <span class="hmd-mono">@HeimdallFmt.Truncate(s.SpanId, 8)</span>
                        @s.Name
                        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(s.ParentSpanId))
                        {
                            <span class="hmd-dim" aria-hidden="true">↳ @HeimdallFmt.Truncate(s.ParentSpanId, 8)</span>
                        }
                    </td>
                    <td>@((Heimdall.HSpanKind)s.Kind)</td>
                    <td>@HeimdallFmt.Ts(s.StartUnixNano)</td>
                    <td>@HeimdallFmt.Dur(s.DurationNs)</td>
                    <td>@(s.StatusCode == 2 ? I18n.T("trace.status.errprefix") + (s.StatusMessage ?? I18n.T("trace.status.err")) : (s.StatusCode == 1 ? I18n.T("traces.status.okbadge") : "—"))</td>
                    <td>
                        <details class="hmd-log-details">
                            <summary class="hmd-log-summary">@I18n.T("trace.attrs.count", attrs.Count) @if (attrs.Count > 0) { <span aria-hidden="true">▸</span> }</summary>
                            <div class="hmd-log-full">
                                @if (attrs.Count > 0)
                                {
                                    <dl class="hmd-attr-list">
                                        @foreach (var a in attrs)
                                        {
                                            <dt>@a.Key</dt><dd>@a.Value</dd>
                                        }
                                    </dl>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <p class="hmd-dim">@I18n.T("trace.attrs.none")</p>
                                }
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(s.EventsJson) && s.EventsJson != "[]")
                                {
                                    <details class="hmd-nested">
                                        <summary>@I18n.T("trace.events")</summary>
                                        <pre class="hmd-pre">@s.EventsJson</pre>
                                    </details>
                                }
                                @if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(s.ResourceJson) && s.ResourceJson != "{}")
                                {
                                    <details class="hmd-nested">
                                        <summary>@I18n.T("trace.resource")</summary>
                                        <pre class="hmd-pre">@s.ResourceJson</pre>
                                    </details>
                                }
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    }

    <h2 class="hmd-subhead">@I18n.T("trace.logs.heading")</h2>
    @if (_logs.Count == 0)
    {
        <p class="hmd-empty" role="status">@I18n.T("trace.logs.empty")</p>
    }
    else
    {
        <table class="hmd-table hmd-logs">
            <caption>@I18n.T("trace.logs.heading")</caption>
            <thead><tr><th class="hmd-col-ts" scope="col">@I18n.T("table.time")</th><th class="hmd-col-sev" scope="col">@I18n.T("table.sev")</th><th scope="col">@I18n.T("table.body")</th><th class="hmd-col-trace" scope="col">@I18n.T("table.trace")</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            @foreach (var l in _logs)
            {
                <HeimdallLogRow Log="@l" BasePath="@BasePath" Expand="@false" />
            }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    }
</HeimdallDocument>

@code {
    [Parameter] public string BasePath { get; set; } = "/otel";
    [Parameter] public string TraceId { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    private List<Heimdall.SpanRow> _spans = new();
    private List<Heimdall.LogRow> _logs = new();
    private string _waterfall = string.Empty;

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(TraceId)) return;
        _spans = new List<Heimdall.SpanRow>(Query.GetTrace(TraceId));
        _waterfall = HeimdallTraceWaterfall.RenderWaterfallSvg(_spans);
        // Korrelation Traces↔Logs: LogSearch.TraceId existiert im Modell — direkter
        // Join über die Trace-ID, kein Zeitfenster nötig (Trace ist selbst begrenzt).
        _logs = new List<Heimdall.LogRow>(Query.SearchLogs(new Heimdall.LogSearch
        {
            TraceId = TraceId,
            Limit = 200,
        }));
    }
}